sequenceDiagram
 participant p0 as Student
 participant p1 as Browser
 participant p2 as API / rules
 participant p3 as SQLite
 p0->>p1: Choose class and press Book
 p1->>p2: POST /api/bookings + CSRF
 p2->>p3: BEGIN IMMEDIATE; read plan, class, bookings
 p3-->>p2: Current membership, seats and overlaps
 p2->>p2: Check role, 48h window and eligibility
 p2->>p3: Insert confirmed OR waitlisted; notify; COMMIT
 p2-->>p1: Return booking state
 p1-->>p0: Show confirmation or queue position
